WEBVTT

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.800
Those Who are Lost in Time's Labyrinth

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.780
If we break Zeus's ring…

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.740
the two Himekas will be saved.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:41.990
Let's go, Karin!

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:42.740
Yeah!

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:48.870
Zeus, the one who holds the power of all gods.

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:51.660
Lend me your power!

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:27.830
Kazune-kun!

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.250
Karin, move!

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:45.930
When this battle is over…

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:48.720
which one of us will disappear?

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.770
No, don't worry…

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:56.260
Kazune-chan and the others…

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:03.130
are fighting… to find a way to save us.

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:09.050
I believe in them.

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.040
Where's Kirio-chan?

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.560
That person is not Kirio-chan.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:25.070
That's not Kirio-chan.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:34.240
What's wrong, Kujyou? Is that all you've got?

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.900
Of course… not!

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.960
You're pretty good, Kujyou.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.010
But the real fight starts now!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.250
Take this!

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:04.050
Kazune-kun!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.890
I'll put an end to you.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.720
Kujyou!

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.310
Look out!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:23.440
Oh? You're blocking it.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:28.130
But, how long can you hold out against Zeus's power?

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:31.660
Why…

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.930
Why do you want God's power so badly?

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:44.020
What do you want to do by becoming that strong?

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:49.320
Using God's power like this…

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.050
is wrong!

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:54.140
Let's put an end to this fight!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.850
Please, just stop!

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:01.410
Are you done talking?

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.410
First I'll destroy the experiment's ring.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.580
Karin…

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:36.110
Give that back!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:43.910
The ring was…

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.450
No!!!

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:14.490
That woman… I saw her before…

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.870
Look, smile for the camera, Himeka.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.420
This setting…

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.010
It's the same as that picture.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:47.090
I hid the research on gods in Himeka.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:52.630
But… Karasuma will probably target me again to find out the research's whereabouts.

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:54.010
No way!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.180
You might be in danger, too.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:00.450
We don't know what Karasuma might do right now.

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:05.150
If I use the research on gods…

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.660
I can return you to a child form.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.610
I want you to change form…

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.090
and remain hidden in some faraway place.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:15.030
It's to protect you.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.280
I have faith.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.340
That even when we're far apart…

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:27.310
I will definitely never forget you.

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:40.740
We'll definitely meet again.

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:50.610
I remember…

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:53.940
My…

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.410
My name is…

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.290
Kujyou Suzuka.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.670
It seems like you've remembered.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:13.800
Yes, you are Kujyou's wife, Suzuka.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.920
You became Kujyou's experiment…

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.190
and he erased your memories.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.010
That's wrong!

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:24.370
I'm… Kazune-kun's…

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:33.670
I'm sorry for keeping quiet up until now.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.150
We were a couple…

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:39.360
and our child is named Himeka.

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:40.740
Himeka-chan?

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.830
I see…

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:54.690
We were really a family…

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:05.970
What's wrong?

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:07.810
Are you alright?

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:16.040
Probably… Karin-chan's ring was… broken.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:20.110
You were in pain, too, weren't you?

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.280
Yeah.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:24.870
I was also lonely.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.830
When Kirio-chan and Kirika-chan weren't there…

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.260
I was alone and couldn't do anything.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:35.960
I understand your feelings.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:41.260
Because we're the same.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:48.180
It's sad just being protected.

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:55.320
I want to help Kazune-chan and Karin-chan as well.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.400
I came this far…

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:04.470
I want to be healthy and free to live the way I want.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:13.270
It seems like you've remembered everything.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:18.480
Now then, there's only one ring remaining.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:22.130
If I break your ring, it's my win.

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:24.680
Kujyou…

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:27.280
let's hurry and put an end to this.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:28.720
Yeah!

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:32.620
My body was made to god transform.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:38.230
Right now, I can use ten times more power than any other normal god.

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.360
In turn for your large amount of power…

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:44.530
your body can't keep up. How much power can you use?

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.660
Kazune-kun, please don't push yourself!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:50.410
If you push yourself too much, your body will…

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:52.960
Right now…

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.080
I don't have time to worry about that!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:58.130
Karasuma!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.210
Kujyou!

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:14.390
It's the end for you!

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:16.270
Hand over Zeus's ring!

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:21.150
See ya, Karasuma Kirihiko.

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:32.540
The exact opposite happened.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:36.600
Even though your body was made to transform.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:39.630
It was fun, Kujyou.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.720
Kazune-kun…

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:51.010
Just a bit farther…

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:54.160
See ya, Kujyou Kazuto.

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:56.160
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:59.700
I am God!

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:04.660
You moron.

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:04.660
It's a croquette!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.180
I'll destroy your ring… Prepare yourself.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.410
Stop it!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:19.790
No!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.590
Get out of the way!

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:24.050
No, I definitely won't!

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:29.660
If you do anything more to Kazune-kun, I'll never forgive you!

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:30.680
Move!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.850
K-Karin…

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.850
Kujyou!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:38.480
Move!

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:39.690
No!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.190
Then I won't show any mercy!

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:57.060
Karin… give up…

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.330
I'm already…

00:12:59.330 --> 00:12:59.880
No!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:02.960
No! No way!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.720
You sure look pretty…

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.850
in those clothes.

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.780
You look like a princess.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:21.940
I remember… that time in the play.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:24.190
The school play?

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:30.610
I told you not to do it.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:32.700
Look at what's happened to you.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:39.180
But I suppose I always knew that this would come to be.

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:45.140
So long as you still stood, I knew you would fight.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.650
It was fun, huh?

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.640
Kazune-kun…

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:59.060
It's the same… as that time.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.100
The same as the play's last scene…

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.730
And if I die in your arms…

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:10.650
then I am happy.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:24.460
Really… as long as I die in your arms… you know?

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:28.860
No… No! I don't want it to end like the play!

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.680
Kazune-kun?

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.310
Kazune-kun…

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.180
No!

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:41.980
Move!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.230
No!!!

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:47.110
Then I'll kill you along with him!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.860
Kazune-kun, I'm sorry…

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:53.360
Himeka-chan, I'm sorry…

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:57.030
I can't do anything…

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.390
Don't give up!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.870
What's the meaning of this…

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.280
Hanazono-san!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.820
Micchi! You were alive!

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:37.760
I'm glad! I'm really glad!

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.060
Micchi?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.890
Sorry, I feel kinda weak.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:57.530
You… you were still alive…

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:03.020
All those who get in my way…

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:05.160
I won't forgive whoever it is!

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.170
This time I'll really put an end to you!

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:16.280
I want to protect them!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.870
No matter what.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.090
No matter what, I want the power to protect them!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.620
Micchi, lend your ring to me!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:44.490
I am God!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.560
Damn it! What is this light?!

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:50.650
It burns!

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:54.380
My body is…

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.990
What's the meaning of this?!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.430
Just a while ago you were dying…

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:03.580
Karin, lend me your power.

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:05.410
Kazune-kun.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.790
I want to protect all of you!

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:13.460
I want to protect you…

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:15.440
and everyone as well!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:20.280
I want to protect all of those precious to me!

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:47.600
Karin, do you remember what I told you when we first met?

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:50.080
Eh? Yeah.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.690
You said "I'm glad that I met you, even if it was short".

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:57.130
I'm really glad that I met you.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:17:59.510
Kazune-kun.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.840
Kujyou!!!

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:10.440
I'll definitely protect them!

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.690
Feelings of wanting to protect, turn into strength…

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.480
and strength turns into power!

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:19.770
I won't lose to you, who pointlessly strives after power!

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:31.710
Kirio, what are you doing?!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:34.170
- Let go, you're in the way, Kirio!

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.170
- It's illusion glasses guy.

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.590
I'm not "illusion glasses guy"!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.460
I'm Karasuma Kirio!

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:39.620
- Let go, let go!

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.510
- Kujyou, hurry and take the ring!

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:41.550
Right!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:45.680
Kujyou! Aim for the ring!

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:18.460
After that, when I came to, I was sleeping in my house.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:21.970
I was in pain for a little while, but I'm fine now.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:25.010
Is that so? I'm glad.

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:28.950
Brother has also healed, and is healthy once again.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.730
I'm sorry for a lot of things, Karin-chan.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.190
No, that's…

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.770
All of the rings disappeared, right?

00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:39.650
Yes.

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:40.720
I see.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:44.740
Now brother should be able to live in peace.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:46.870
Himeka became healthy too.

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:49.580
Our Himeka-chan is healthy as well.

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:53.790
It's been two weeks since then…

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.600
Kazune-kun still hasn't been found?

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.540
No…

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.130
You must be worried.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:01.690
I hope he's safe.

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.550
It's the same for dad, of course, but…

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:12.980
for us humans a large amount of power…

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.200
is something we don't need.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.820
Too much power…

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:22.540
throws off the balance and just causes misery.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:27.610
Why do people want so much power?

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:36.370
It's pointless to be here if there's no Kujyou-kun!

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:38.640
I feel like my sushi's missing its wasabi!

00:20:38.640 --> 00:20:40.420
It's a tragedy if he's not here!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:42.960
Hurry and come back!

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:46.050
Kujyou-kun!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:59.440
Tree climbing glasses guy, second edition!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:02.000
Stop calling me stuff like "tree climbing glasses guy"!

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:05.070
I'm Karasuma Kirio!

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:08.490
Why did you fall from a tree?

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:12.950
I've been carefully observing you guys from the trees.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:15.660
How weird, even though the fighting is over.

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:17.360
It's not over yet.

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:20.680
I want to settle things with Kujyou.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:24.000
When he gets back, tell him I want a rematch.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:27.550
But you'll lose right away.

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:28.860
That's fine.

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:37.870
Thank you, glasses guy.

00:23:15.530 --> 00:23:20.040
This is… the first place I met Kazune-kun.

00:23:24.710 --> 00:23:26.290
Kazune-kun…

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:30.170
No, don't cry!

00:23:31.420 --> 00:23:32.940
What're you doing?

00:23:35.300 --> 00:23:37.100
It's the same as that time.

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:42.640
You did well, Karin.

00:23:42.640 --> 00:23:45.690
Thank goodness! I missed you!

00:23:47.770 --> 00:23:51.530
From here on, I wonder what awaits us?

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:53.450
Let's go, Karin.

00:23:53.450 --> 00:23:56.910
Alright! Leave it to the mini-goddess!

00:23:56.910 --> 00:24:00.140
I am God!
